# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; keep it that way.
#
# WARNING: every VITE_* value is written into the public index.html and is
# readable by anyone who loads the site. Publishable values only.

# Web3Forms — access key is public by design. Leave empty and the enquiry
# form falls back to opening the visitor's e-mail client.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
